\b AI Teacher Radar\b0\par
\par
A local, self-hosted news radar for AI model training, distillation and coder-model work. It runs entirely on this machine: sources are public RSS and APIs, and summarisation uses your local Ollama install. No data is sent to any third-party service by this application.\par
\par
\b Prerequisites\b0 , which this installer does NOT include:\par
\par
\bullet  Docker Desktop (the radar runs as a container)\par
\bullet  The .NET 9 Desktop Runtime (for the tray app)\par
\bullet  Ollama, plus at least one model, for the written summaries\par
\bullet  Optional: an NVIDIA GPU and container toolkit for GPU-aware scheduling\par
\par
Run "Check prerequisites" from the Start Menu after installing to see what is missing on this machine.\par
\par
This software is provided as is, without warranty of any kind.\par
